.jpg","genre_ids":[12,27,878],"id":3484,"title":"The Mask of Fu Manchu","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Mask of Fu Manchu","overview":"The villainous Dr. Fu Manchu races against a team of Englishmen to find the tomb of Ghengis Khan, because he wants to use the relics to cause an uprising in the East to wipe out the white race.","popularity":3.5886,"poster_path":"/4iMjZwxFGxlF0RkfSAzgn6iTUb3.jpg","release_date":"1932-11-04","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.4,"vote_count":89},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jT87AtLCe2XAYt31qiON1oGQ4Pe.jpg","genre_ids":[53,27],"id":1031929,"title":"Howdy, Neighbor!","original_language":"en","original_title":"Howdy, Neighbor!","overview":"Benjamin is a young queer millennial actor living in West Hollywood who was once a famous child actor. When a new neighbor Chase moves across the hall and reveals himself as a fan, Benjamin begins investigating the oddly familiar man with his best friend Harley.","popularity":2.2767,"poster_path":"/uJG214eRTyZy9IzHmh34XtzHNtU.jpg","release_date":"2023-07-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/zwDhFrSHnAKc9V1G7Fxz5TCt2pv.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,18,14],"id":453347,"title":"Sicilian Ghost Story","original_language":"it","original_title":"Sicilian Ghost Story","overview":"In a little Sicilian village at the edge of a forest, Giuseppe, a boy of 13, vanishes. Luna, his classmate who loves him, refuses to accept his mysterious disappearance. She rebels against the silence and complicity that surround her, and to find him she descends into the dark world which has swallowed him up and which has a lake as its mysterious entrance.","popularity":3.5321,"poster_path":"/bqKVM6ujKR1UkyehoRaBsxw2D8w.jpg","release_date":"2017-11-18","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":151},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[27,9648],"id":268269,"title":"Naprata","original_language":"sr","original_title":"Naprata","overview":"Inspired by an infamous online video clip of a son beating his mother, a television crew from Belgrade comes to a remote Serbian village to shoot a report on violence against women. Inquiring with the locals about the protagonists of the video, they encounter a local expert on supernatural phenomena and learn about a ritual of summoning an ancient demon, naprata. Wanting to capture the first authentic footage of something otherworldly, they change their plans. Excited by the prospective success of the recording, they defy the old saying that \"it's better to believe than to be convinced.\"","popularity":1.8656,"poster_path":"/bq8RkZGnWtpwGCsGFpCACwmKYKH.jpg","release_date":"2013-10-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.5,"vote_count":3},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/LuqbxUCivUF7Frsk1Y5hrodTGE.jpg","genre_ids":[27,53],"id":1222535,"title":"Dolida","original_language":"es","original_title":"Dolida","overview":"\"Dolida\" is the female cry of internal struggle, within a violent macho society full of dangers. Our film recounts the inner journey of a young woman, which will take her through chapters full of pain, which have ended up defining part of her psychological evolution process.","popularity":1.5938,"poster_path":"/3ha0PWKTmR59QTkwNFSQTJgyRyF.jpg","release_date":"","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6MnTqrSRsikuk085CS63StW376i.jpg","genre_ids":[27],"id":1419876,"title":"Disectoid","original_language":"en","original_title":"Disectoid","overview":"What seems like an average day on the course is anything but that! When a young caddie named Ron (Jay Maudlin) is fired by his Boss (Lucas Rendón), he must do what he thinks is right as a response to the predicament. Shot, filmed, and edited in 10 days, Disectoid is akin to late night Adult Swim programming and unlike anything you've ever seen.","popularity":1.0642,"poster_path":"/dr2DGjvpb5sjRLz9RFF8AEWaGT4.jpg","release_d